": \"秦简文字“前”字，从舟从刂\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"汉代帛书“前”字，从舟从刂\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“前”字，渐近楷书形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“歴”字，从止从冧\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"西周金文“歴”字，从止从广从林\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"西周金文“歴”字，左止右广内林\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“歴”字，从广从麻从止\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"汉代印文“歴”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"汉代文字“歴”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"楷书异体“歴”字，广下禾止\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0119/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n120:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000120\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 120, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"81ee3509a509c9fd56f40b21e932a82c1c136c3f02e071626ffc8b03383d4006\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"9f193b678f060d992081fc49c99b62da46eb50272780ab82a8b2d12d1fa44838\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"止部 癶部\\n\\n歸 (归) guī 见组、微部;见组、微韵、举韦切。\\nkuì 群组、微部;群组、至韵、求位切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001] 商\\n[glyph:g002] 商\\n[glyph:g003] 西周\\n[glyph:g004] 西周\\n[glyph:g005] 战国\\n[glyph:g006] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g007] 战国\\n[glyph:g008] 秦\\n[glyph:g009] 汉\\n[glyph:g010] 汉\\n[glyph:g011] 汉\\n归 楷书\\n归 楷书\\n\\n1《甲文编》56页。2、3、4《金文编》85页。\\n5、7、8《战文编》83页。6《说文》38页。9《马\\n王堆》58页。10、11《甲金篆》95页。\\n形声字。甲骨文作[glyph:g012]、[glyph:g013],从帚,自声。西周金文或\\n加疋旁,乃示动符号。自旁上加Ψ乃因𦥑(辭字从之,“辞”\\n在金文中多用为治理义)字而类化,战国文字承袭西周金\\n文,或省疋旁作[glyph:g014](这种写法殷商甲骨文、西周金文中都存\\n在,战国文字中的这种写法可以看作是继承古体,但从文字演\\n变角度考虑,还是看作“歸”之省),或省自作“[glyph:g015]”。《正字\\n通》:“暹,同歸。”《说文》:“歸,女嫁也。从止、从妇省,\\n自声。”其本义指女子出嫁,《易·渐》:“女归,吉。”《国\\n语·晋语四》:“秦伯归女五人。”即用本义。由出嫁义引\\n申为往、依归义,进一步可引申指归宿。有往必有还,因\\n而又引申出返回义。《乙》961:“贞:王其归。”令鼎:“王\\n归自词田。”均用此义。由返回引申出归还义。以上诸义\\n音读 guī。“归”还有馈赠、给予义,通“馈”,读为 kuì。\\n其实此义亦由出嫁义引申而来,出嫁即以夫为家,等于\\n女儿给了别人。只不过人曰“归”,予物则曰“馈”,开始\\n本用同一字,只是音读有些差异而已。貉子卣:“王令士\\n道归貉子鹿三。”“归”即通“馈”。(陈英杰)\\n\\n涩 sè 心组、缉部;生组、缉韵、色立切。\\nshà 生组、狎韵、色甲切。\\n\\n[glyph:g016] 商\\n[glyph:g017] 汉\\n[glyph:g018] 《说文》小篆\\n涩 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲金篆》96页。3《说文》38页。\\n\\n会意字。从四止,顺逆相抵,盖有不能行义。《玉\\n篇》:“澀,难转也。”《说文》训为“不滑也”,义即不滑润、\\n滞涩。字同“澀”(“涩”之繁体)。甲骨文从二止作[glyph:g019]或从\\n三止作[glyph:g020],汉《司隶校尉杨孟文石门颂》承之作“[glyph:g021]”,曰:\\n“埜(途)路歰难。”即以“歰”为“涩”,是“歰”字汉时尚存。\\n引申指不通畅、口吃、粗涩、味涩等义。《说文》无“澀”有\\n“𣥪”,《集韵·缉韵》和《字汇补·止部》都收录了“澀”的\\n简体“涩”,曰与“涩”、“澀”同。涩、澀并涩之俗,涩与澀今\\n归并简化为涩。涩是现代群众新造的简化字。《说文·水\\n部》:“澁,不滑也。”“涩”与“澁”属异部重文。以上诸义\\n音读 sè。“澀”或与“銴”通,指古代出殡时棺上的羽饰,\\n《集韵·狎韵》色甲切,音读 shà。(陈英杰)\\n\\n癶部\\n\\n此(癶) bō 帮组、月部;帮组、末韵、北末切。\\n\\n[glyph:g022] 战国\\n[glyph:g023] 《说文》小篆\\n此 楷书\\n\\n1《甲金篆》96页。2《说文》38页。\\n象形字。像左右二足分张之形,人两足分张则行\\n而不正,字之本义即行步不正。《说文》:“癶,足剌癶\\n也。”“刺癶”亦作“撇跋”。《说文·足部》:“跟,步行獵\\n跋也。”跟与癶同词异字。或作“刺发”,或倒言之曰“泼\\n刺”。汉陆贾《新语·怀虑》:“拨刺难匡。”或作“赖跟”、\\n“躊跟”。均含不正之义。“癶”本义为两足分张,引申为\\n弓张也。(陈英杰)\\n\\n登 dēng 端组、蒸部;端组、登韵、都滕切。\\n\\n[glyph:g024] 商\\n[glyph:g025] 商\\n[glyph:g026] 商\\n[glyph:g027] 西周\\n[glyph:g028] 春秋\\n[glyph:g029] 战国\\n[glyph:g030] 《说文》籀文\\n[glyph:g031] 秦\\n[glyph:g032] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g033] 秦\\n[glyph:g034] 汉\\n[glyph:g035] 汉\\n登 楷书\\n\\n1、2《甲文编》58页。3、4、5《金文编》86\\n页。6《战文编》86页。7、9《说文》38页。8、12\\n《甲金篆》96页。10《睡甲》18页。11《马王堆》\\n59页。\\n形声字。甲骨文有[glyph:g036](昙)字,像两手捧食器以进\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0120/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0120/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0120/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文字形，从帚自\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0120/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文字形，从帚自\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0120/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"西周金文字形，加疋旁及饰笔\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0120/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"西周金文字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0120/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国文字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziy