 \"汉代字形“隨”\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0126/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g028\", \"description\": \"汉代字形“随”，左阝右有走底\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0126/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n128:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000128\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 128, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"15e387b11f82a64d03c585842138fece17470d3eb180f99d5c1c35402639e83c\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"41e462489db17ec6f800c8c286cf6208f8501065022ad5b8fd608b2a52ce062b\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"疋部\\n\\n形声字。从辵，商声。商从口，帝声。帝甲骨文中即有，象形字。啻在偏旁中隶定为商。西周金文中假啻为“適”。战国时期增形符是以示义。或从止，止、辵为义近形符。声符或省去啻下边的口，仅从帝声。或不从口而从日，口、日古文字中常通。《说文》小篆则从辵，啻声。汉代声符啻简化为商，商又或讹变为形近的商等。楷书回归为从辵，商声。现代简化字以音近之“舌”代替“商”，“適”遂写作“适”。本义为往、至。《诗·郑风·缁衣》：“适子之馆兮，还予授子之粲兮。”毛传：“适，之。”引申可指归从、向、女子出嫁、符合、恰当、美好、快乐、自得貌、节制等意义。又作副词，义为恰巧、正好、刚刚等。适又音dí，有跟从、顺从之义。《左传·僖公五年》：“狐裘龙茸，一国三公，吾谁适从。”陆德明释文：“适从，丁历反。”又有亲厚义。适或用同“嫡”，又或通“敌”、“谪”等。(师玉梅)\\n\\n過(过) guò 见纽、歇部;见纽、过韵、古卧切。\\nguō 见纽、歇部;见纽、戈韵、古禾切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001] [glyph:g002] [glyph:g003] [glyph:g004] [glyph:g005] [glyph:g006] [glyph:g007] [glyph:g008] [glyph:g009]\\n西周 西周 战国《说文》小篆 秦 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1、2《金文编》94页。3《战文编》92页。4《说文》39页。5、6、7《甲金篆》102~103页。\\n\\n形声字。从辵，咼声。金文或从止，辵、止为义近形符，古文字中常可通。咼，从口、呙声。𠮮(呙)乃骨之初文，从口以后表示口歪斜。咼作声符形体很不稳定，战国时或有作“[glyph:g010]”形，至汉代则有局、冎、冏、咼、局、局等诸形，楷书主要承袭了第一个形体。现代汉字因草书楷化而以“寸”代替了“咼”，“過”遂写作了“过”。本义为经过。《论语·宪问》：“子击磬于卫，有荷蒉而过孔氏之门者。”引申可指渡过、过去、拜访、给予、转移、超过、过分、过失、责备等义。也引申表示度过、过活，或过继、入赘、嫁入，或委婉表示去世。过可作量词，相当于遍、次。过作国名、地名、姓时读guō。《左传·襄公四年》：“(寒浞)处浇于过，处殪于戈。”杜预注：“过，国名，东莱掖县北有过乡。”金文中“过伯”。近、现代汉语中过还常作结构助词，读轻声guo。过或通“祸”。《睡虎地秦墓竹简·为吏之道》：“毋喜富，毋恶贫，正行修身，过去福存。”(师玉梅)\\n\\n進(进) jìn 精纽、真部;精纽、震韵、即刃切。\\n\\n[glyph:g011] [glyph:g012] [glyph:g013] [glyph:g014] [glyph:g015] [glyph:g016] [glyph:g017] [glyph:g018]\\n商 西周 战国《说文》小篆 汉 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《甲文编》72页。2《金文编》94页。3《战文编》92页。4《说文》39页。5、6《甲金篆》103页。\\n\\n会意字。从辵，从隹。现代简化字以“井”代替了“隹”，“進”遂写作了“进”。《说文》：“進，登也。从辵，閵省声。”高鸿缙《字例》：“(甲骨文)字从隹，从止，会意。止即脚，隹脚能进不能退，故以取意……周人变为隹辵，意亦同。不当为形声。”隹初文像鸟形。进始见于甲骨文，甲骨文从止、从隹，金文以后多从辵、从隹。止、辵为义近形符，古文字中常通。进的古文字形中未见从閵者，《说文》“閵省声”恐非。进本义为前进。《诗·大雅·常武》：“进厥虎臣，阚如虓虎。”郑玄笺：“进，前也。”引申可有行、进步、促进、出仕、引进、举荐、提升、进献、靠近、超过、进入等意义。进或通“峻”。《荀子·非十二子》：“士君子之容，其冠进，其衣逢。”清俞樾《诸子平议》：“进，读为峻，高也。”又或通“尽”。(师玉梅)\\n\\n造 zào 从纽、幽部;从纽、皓韵、昨早切。\\ncào 清纽、幽部;清纽、号韵、七到切。\\n\\n[glyph:g019]\\n春秋\\n[glyph:g020] [glyph:g021]\\n西周《说文》古文\\n[glyph:g022] [glyph:g023] [glyph:g024] [glyph:g025] [glyph:g026] [glyph:g027] [glyph:g028] [glyph:g029]\\n西周 西周 西周 战国《说文》小篆 秦 汉 楷书\\n[glyph:g030]\\n战国\\n\\n1-5《金文编》94~95页。6、9《说文》39页。7、8《战文编》92~93页。10、11《甲金篆》103页。\\n\\n形声字。从辵，告声。《说文》：“造，就也。从辵，告声。谭长说，造，上土也。𩫸，古文造从舟。”造的字形在《说文》小篆之前异体繁多。西周金文作𩫸，从宀从舟，告声。春秋战国时期或省去宀，从舟，告声。高鸿缙《颂器考释》：“𩫸，制造之本字，亦作艁，从宀、从舟，告声。言屋或舟均人所制造也。后世通以造访之造代之，久而成习，而𩫸与艁均废。”西周金文另有䆚、䆚等形，战国时\\n\\n116\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"西周金文“過”字，左为辵旁，右为咼\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"西周金文“過”字异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"战国文字“過”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“過”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"秦代简帛“過”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“過”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“過”字异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"楷书繁体“過”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"楷书简化“过”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"战国文字中“咼”的异体字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"商代甲骨文“進”字，止在下隹在上\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"西周金文“進”字，从辵从隹\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"战国文字“進”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“進”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“進”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“進”字异体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"楷书繁体“進”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"楷书简化“进”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"春秋金文“造”字异体（标号5）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"西周金文“造”字异体（标号3）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"《说文》古文“造”字（标号6，即𩫸）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"西周金文“造”字（标号1）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"西周金文“造”字（标号2）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g024\", \"description\": \"西周金文“造”字（标号4）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g025\", \"description\": \"战国文字“造”字（标号7）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g026\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆秦“造”字（标号9）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g027\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“造”字（标号10）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g028\", \"description\": \"汉代隶书“造”字（标号11）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g029\", \"description\": \"楷书“造”字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g030\", \"description\": \"战国文字“造”字异体（标号8）\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0128/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [\"造字头部的数个字形编号与字形分布排列较为分散，字形顺序按图表中对应编号与对应时代标签进行转录\"], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n131:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:000131\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 131, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"46e7389001a6862810f762f7e0f079049c10f92fc65641fff281910a55e6e39f\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"0a5d34c6d563b9625d7ef089fb805b95f6c10ca2bfb4e41b754519ff137667ed\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"遄 速 迅 适 逆 迎 遇 遭 遘 逢\\n\\n形声兼会意字。从辵,从[glyph:g001], [glyph:g001]亦声。始见于甲骨文。甲骨文和金文中“[glyph:g001]”像倒人形,表示顺逆的“逆”,当为“逆”字初文。《说文·[glyph:g002]部》：“[glyph:g001],不顺也。”段玉裁注：“后人多用逆,逆行而[glyph:g001]废矣。”甲骨文和金文[glyph:g001]或增止,或增彳、[glyph:g003]符,表示迎接。罗振玉《增订殷墟书契考释》：“(甲骨文)象(倒)人自外入,而是以迎之。或省彳,或省止。”《说文》：“逆,迎也。从辵,[glyph:g001]声。关东曰逆,关西曰迎。”《金璋所藏甲骨卜辞》508：“贞：[glyph:g004]方其来,王逆伐?”逆伐即迎击。引申可有接受、倒着、退后、不顺从、叛乱、猜度等意义。逆字中的声符兼意符“[glyph:g001]”隶书或讹作与之形近的“羊”形,实与羊字无关。(师玉梅)\\n\\n迎 yíng 疑组、阳部；疑组、庚韵、语京切。\\nyìng 疑组、阳部；疑组、映韵、鱼敬切。\\n[glyph:g005] 战国\\n[glyph:g006] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g007] 汉\\n[glyph:g008] 汉\\n迎 楷书\\n1、3、4《甲金篆》105页。2《说文》40页。\\n形声字。从辵,卬声。约始见于战国,本义为迎接。《说文》：“迎,逢也。”《方言》卷一：“逢、逆,迎也。自关而东曰逆,自关而西或曰迎,或曰逢。”《仪礼·士昏礼》：“主人如宾服迎于门外。”引申有迎合、正对着、反向、推算等意义。《洪武正韵·庚韵》：“迎,凡物来而接之则平声,物未来而往迓之使来则去声。”从而可知表示前往迎接则读yìng。《诗·大雅·大明》：“文定厥祥,亲迎于渭。”(师玉梅)\\n\\n遇 yù 疑组、侯部；疑组、遇韵、牛具切。\\n[glyph:g009] 西周\\n[glyph:g010] 战国\\n[glyph:g011] 战国\\n[glyph:g012] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g013] 汉\\n[glyph:g014] 汉\\n遇 楷书\\n1《金文编》97页。2《古玺》36页。3《战文编》95页。4《说文》40页。5、6《甲金篆》106页。\\n形声字。从辵,禺声。约始见于西周。金文从寓声。寓本义为寄居,从宀,禺声。战国遇或见从彳,[glyph:g015]、[glyph:g016]为义近形符,古文字中常通。遇本义为相逢、不期而会。《说文》：“遇,逢也。”《书·胤征》：“入自北门,乃遇汝鸠、汝方。”孔传：“不期而会曰遇。”引申有遭受、投合、得志、见赏、机会、抵挡、对待等义。或通“愚”,义为愚笨。《墨子·非儒下》：“盛为声乐,以淫遇民。”孙诒让间诂：“遇与愚通。”(师玉梅)\\n\\n遭 zāo 精组、幽部；精组、豪韵、作曹切。\\n[glyph:g017] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g018] 汉\\n[glyph:g019] 汉\\n[glyph:g020] 汉\\n遭 楷书\\n1《说文》40页。2《篆文编》89页。3、4《甲金篆》106页。\\n形声字。从辵,曹声。约始见于秦汉。声符曹甲骨文作[glyph:g021],又或加口作[glyph:g022],上部原是一对口袋,表示“成对”(曹古义为成对)的意思。金文作[glyph:g023],战国时或省去一个柬写作[glyph:g024],汉代以后瞽上部的两个柬省写作[glyph:g025],或单写作[glyph:g026],又或合写作曲。遭本义为遇到。《说文》：“遭,遇也。”《诗·齐风·还》：“子之还兮,遭我乎狪之间兮。”由遇到引申出遭受,多指不幸或不利的事,这个意义今天常用。遭还有巡行、环绕而行的意思。《说文》：“遭,一日逦行。”段玉裁注：“俗云週遭是也。”王筠句读：“谓周币也,迤逦而行,则旋转而周遭矣。”由此义又可引申作量词,义为周、圈。进而再引申表次、回等。(师玉梅)\\n\\n遘 gòu 见组、侯部；见组、候韵、古候切。\\n[glyph:g027] 商\\n[glyph:g028] 商\\n[glyph:g029] 西周\\n[glyph:g030] 商\\n[glyph:g031] 西周\\n[glyph:g032] 《说文》小篆\\n[glyph:g033] 汉\\n[glyph:g034] 汉\\n遘 楷书\\n1、2、3《甲文编》65~66页。4、5《金文编》97页。6《说文》40页。7、8《甲金篆》106页。\\n形声字。从辵,冓声。始见于商代。甲骨文之遘又从止,或从彳。止、彳、辵为义近形符,古文字中常通用无别。声符冓甲骨文字形象二鱼相遇,盖为遘之本字。《甲》3186：“丁酉卜,宾贞：今日不遘雨?”遘本义为遇到。《说文》：“遘,遇也。”《拾》7.9：“其遘小风。”(会遇上小风吧?遘与“雚雨”之雚表义同)卜辞、金文中遘字又常作祭名。遘或通“媾”。克罍：“隹(唯)用猷于师尹、朋友、婚遘(媾)。”又或通“构”或“娠”。(师玉梅)\\n\\n逢 féng 並组、东部；奉组、钟韵、符容切。\\npéng 並组、东部、蒲蒙切。\\n\\n119\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"古文字“屰”形，像倒人形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"小篆“屰”字，倒人立于地上\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"古文字辵/足形符号\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"甲骨文方国名/人名符号，形似左右结构的合字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"战国迎字，带彳/辵与卬\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆迎字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"汉代迎字隶书形式一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"汉代迎字隶书形式二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"西周遇字金文，从辵从寓\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"战国遇字形式一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"战国遇字形式二，从彳\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆遇字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"汉代遇字隶书形式一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"汉代遇字隶书形式二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g015\", \"description\": \"古文字辵偏旁形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g016\", \"description\": \"古文字走/辵偏旁形体\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g017\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆遭字\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g018\", \"description\": \"汉代遭字隶书形式一\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g019\", \"description\": \"汉代遭字隶书形式二\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g020\", \"description\": \"汉代遭字隶书形式三\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g021\", \"description\": \"曹字甲骨文初文，象两束\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g022\", \"description\": \"曹字甲骨文加口形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-0131/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g023\", \"description\": \"曹字金文字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/ha