/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1120/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g040\", \"description\": \"楷书“氐”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1120/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n1132:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:001132\", \"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"book\": {\"book_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"pdf_sha256\": \"610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721\", \"source_pdf_paths\": [\"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\"], \"current_source_filename\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"title\": null, \"author\": null, \"editor\": null, \"edition\": null, \"year\": null, \"publisher\": null, \"volume\": null, \"isbn\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": {}, \"total_pdf_pages\": 1435}, \"source_file\": \"字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"source_pdf\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/字源 - 李学勤 - 天津古籍出版社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1132, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"7197df679cbf67e4c05500a93e4e8612658aa5406054da7b70e844455d4d3c89\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"6e47a0c2f05379ce00c6c921ff4321b0fe99c669688921e86daad5ed2ff9459e\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"匚 匿 匮 医 医 匹 匚 匠 医\\n\\n字并从匚、晏声,为《说文》篆文所本。“晏”之形体演变,参“晏”字条。本义是隐藏。《说文》:“匿,匿也。”通“燕”,古国名,周武王封召公于北燕。燕侯旨鼎:“匿(燕)侯旨初见事于宗周。”(燕侯旨首次在宗周勤劳王事)通“宴”,宴饮。子璋钟:“用匿(宴)以喜。”林氏壶:“吾以匿(宴)饮。”(徐在国)\\n\\n匚 部\\n\\n匚 fāng 帮组、阳部;非组、阳韵、府良切。\\n\\n[glyph:g001]¹ [glyph:g002]² [glyph:g003]³ [glyph:g004]⁴ [glyph:g005]⁵ [glyph:g006]⁶ [glyph:g007]⁷ [glyph:g008]⁸ 匚\\n商 商 商 商 商 商 《说文》籀文 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1—4《甲文编》500页。5、6《金文编》843页。7、8《说文》268页。\\n\\n象形字。甲骨文“匚”字作[glyph:g009],像方形侧面器之形。或简化作匚,为《说文》篆文所本。金文承袭甲骨文,或作[glyph:g010]、[glyph:g011],为《说文》籀文所本。《说文》:“匚,受物之器。象形。读若方。”本义是方形的受物器。甲骨文“匚”字或读为“枋”,祭名。《合集》1971:“丙寅卜贞:彤匚于丁三十小牢。”(丙寅占卜并贞问:用三十小牢彤祭枋祭于丁)或读为“报”。《殷契粹编》118:“祝三匚(报)惠羊。”(用羊祝祭报乙、报丙、报丁)(徐在国)\\n\\n医 yī 影组、脂部;影组、霁韵、於计切。\\n\\n[glyph:g012]¹ [glyph:g013]² 医\\n战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《战文编》191页殿字偏旁。2《说文》267页。\\n\\n会意字。从矢在匚中。本义是盛弓弩矢的器具。《说文》:“医,盛弓弩矢器也。从匚、从矢。《国语》曰:‘兵不解医。’”段玉裁注:“今《国语》作‘翳’,段借字。韦曰:‘翳,所以蔽兵也。’”(徐在国)\\n\\n匠 jiàng 从组、阳部;从组、漾韵、疾亮切。\\n\\n[glyph:g014]¹ [glyph:g015]² [glyph:g016]³ [glyph:g017]⁴ [glyph:g018]⁵ 匠\\n战国 战国 战国 《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n\\n1、2、3《战文编》827页。4《说文》268页。5《篆隶表》905页。\\n\\n会意字。《说文》:“匠,木工也。从匚,从斤。斤,所以作器也。”战国文字“匠”字从[glyph:g019]、从斤,或从匚、从斤。后者为《说文》篆文所本。“匠”本义是木工。《孟子·尽心上》:“大匠不为拙工改废绳墨。”(高明的木匠不因为拙劣工人改变或者废弃规矩)。引申指有专门技术的工人。《广韵·漾韵》:“匠,工匠。”《古陶文汇编》5·321:“大匠。”指的是陶匠。引申义还有制造、教、巧妙地构思等。(徐在国)\\n\\n匹 pǐ 滂组、质部;滂组、质韵、譬吉切。\\n\\n[glyph:g020]¹ [glyph:g021]² [glyph:g022]³ [glyph:g023]⁴ [glyph:g024]⁵ [glyph:g025]⁶ [glyph:g026]⁷ [glyph:g027]⁹\\n西周 西周 西周 西周 西周 西周 战国 秦\\n[glyph:g028]⁸\\n战国\\n[glyph:g029]¹⁰ [glyph:g030]¹¹ 匹\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书\\n\\n1-6《金文编》842页。7、8《楚系简帛》882页。9《战文编》827页。10《说文》267页。11《篆隶表》905页。\\n\\n形声字。西周金文“匹”字从石、乙声。“石”内或加点为饰,“石”上或加横为饰。“乙”或讹作“[glyph:g031]”,或繁化作“[glyph:g032]”。战国文字“匹”贽加义符“马”,乃马匹之“匹”的专字。秦简“匹”字作[glyph:g033],为《说文》篆文所本。《说文》认为“从八、匚”,误。“匹”乃《说文》篆文之隶定。“匹”指布帛四丈为一匹。《说文》:“匹,四丈也。”《汉书·食货志下》:“布帛广二尺二寸为幅,长四丈为匹。”又指计算马的单位。令甲盘:“王赐兮甲马四匹。”晉鼎:“匹马束丝。”《曾侯乙墓》187:“三匹驷。”引申有匹配、辅助义。单伯钟:“遵(弼)匹先王。”(辅佐先王)《诗·大雅·文王有声》:“作丰伊匹。”毛传:“匹,配也。”(徐在国)\\n\\n匧(箧) qiè 溪组、葉部;溪组、帖韵、苦协切。\\n\\n[glyph:g034]¹ [glyph:g035]² 匧\\n秦 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n[glyph:g036]³ [glyph:g037]⁴ 箧 箧\\n《说文》小篆 汉 楷书 楷书\\n\\n1《睡甲》190页。2、3《说文》268页。4《篆\\n\\n1117\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“匚”字形1，三面框形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“匚”字形2，开口向左的框形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“匚”字形3，左侧开口方框\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"甲骨文“匚”字形4，左侧开口方框带小凸起\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"金文“匚”字形5，左侧开口多重转折框\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"金文“匚”字形6，左侧开口方框内侧有回曲\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"《说文》籀文“匚”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“匚”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"文中所举甲骨文“匚”字形，侧视受物器象形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"文中所举金文“匚”异体字形1\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"文中所举金文“匚”异体字形2\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"战国文字“医”字形，匚中容矢\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g013\", \"description\": \"《说文》小篆“医”字形\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1132/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g014\", \"description\": \"战国文字“匠”字形1