社 (3 volumes combined) -- 《字源》·李学勤·天津古籍出版社·2012_pdf -- 全三册, 2012 -- 天津：天津古籍出版社；沈阳：辽宁人民出版社 -- isbn13 9787552800692 -- 3dde16e8457f7b.pdf\", \"pdf_page_1based\": 1307, \"printed_page\": null, \"metadata_provenance\": null, \"source_sha256\": \"ca52b3b287e090d5bc6327daeaa2cbca79dbb0c5ecff5fd11c6e2d9e7b2c6bed\", \"evidence_sha256\": \"bcd865bf7f3f44493269b82cfe88493001295c37f718635d47d6633387cf3ea5\", \"ocr_review_status\": \"unreviewed\", \"review_dimensions\": {\"transcription\": \"unreviewed\", \"layout\": \"not_requested\", \"glyph_identification\": \"page_references_only_no_crops\"}, \"text\": \"酉部 酋部 戌部 亥部\\n\\n[glyph:g001] mǐng 明纽、耕部;明纽、迥韵、莫迥切。\\n\\n[glyph:g002]¹—[glyph:g001]\\n《说文》新附 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》313页。\\n形声字。酩酊,醉得迷迷糊糊的样子。《说文》:“酩,酩酊,醉也。从酉,名声。”(李义海)\\n\\n酊 dǐng 端纽、耕部;端纽、迥韵、都挺切。\\n\\n[glyph:g003]¹—酊\\n《说文》新附 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》313页。\\n形声字。酩酊,醉得迷迷糊糊的样子。《说文》:“酊,酩酊也。从酉,丁声。”(李义海)\\n\\n醒 xǐng 心纽、耕部;心纽、青韵、桑经切。\\njīng 子清切。\\n\\n[glyph:g004]¹—醒\\n《说文》新附 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》313页。\\n形声字。酒醉后恢复常态。《说文》:“醒,醉解也。从酉,星声。”引申为睡眠状态的结束。唐韩愈《东都遇春》:“朝曦入牖来,鸟唤昏不醒。”又指南未入睡。宋梅尧臣《永叔赠酒》:“一日复一日,醒目常不眠。”由酒醒又引申为清醒、明白。《史记·屈原列传》:“举世混浊而我独清,众人皆醉而我独醒。”以上意义读 xǐng。字又读 jīng,星名。《字汇补·酉部》:“醒,《孙氏瑞应图》:大醒,景星也。”(李义海)\\n\\n醍 tí 透纽、支部;透纽、荠韵、他礼切。\\ntí 定纽、齐韵、杜奚切。\\n\\n[glyph:g005]¹—醍\\n《说文》新附 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》313页。\\n形声字。较清的红色酒。《礼记·礼运》:“粢醍在堂。”《说文》:“醍,清酒也。从酉,是声。”读 tí。醍醐,奶油。《广韵·齐韵》:“醍,醍醐。”《集韵·模韵》:“醐,醍醐,酥之精液。”又以喻指佛性。《正字通·酉部》:“梵书以醍醐喻佛性。”读 tí。(李义海)\\n\\n[glyph:g006] yǎn 影纽、侵部;影纽、琰韵、于琰切。\\nyàn 影纽、艳韵、于艳切。\\nyǐn 影纽、寝韵、于锦切。\\n\\n[glyph:g007]¹ [glyph:g008]² [glyph:g009]³ [glyph:g010]⁴ [glyph:g011]⁵—[glyph:g006]\\n商 商 西周 战国 《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1-4《类编》329页。5《说文解字系传》283页。\\n形声字。字自商至《说文》小篆均从酉,今声本义为酒味苦。清段玉裁《说文解字注》:“[glyph:g006],酒味苦也。从酉,今声。”读 yǎn;字又读 yàn,指酒盈量。《集韵·艳韵》:“[glyph:g006],酒盈量也。”又读 yǐn,指密闭。明方以智《物理小识·器用类》引《清波志》曰:“佩香用久不香,以虎子[glyph:g006]一夕则香。”在楚简中常假为“饮”。《九店楚简》35:“利於[glyph:g006]食”。又假为“含”。郭店楚墓竹简33:“[glyph:g006]德之厚者,比於赤子,虺虿蟲它弗螫,攫鳥猛獸弗喵,骨弱莖柔而握。”(李义海)\\n\\n酉部\\n\\n酋 qiú 从纽、幽部;从纽、尤韵、鲁刀切。\\n\\n[glyph:g012]¹—酋\\n《说文》小篆 楷书\\n\\n1《说文》313页。\\n象形字。从酉,从八。像清酒现于酒滓之上。本义为久酿之酒。《说文》:“酋,绎酒也。从酉,水半见于上。”引申为久。《方言》卷七:“酋,熟也。自河以北,赵魏之间火熟曰烂,气熟曰糟,久熟曰酋。”由久又引申为年长,故酋长同义连用。又引申为精熟。《国语·郑语》:“毒之酋腊者,其杀也滋速。”韦昭注:“精熟为酋。”(李义海)\\n\\n尊 zūn 精纽、文部;精纽、魂韵、祖昆切。\\n\\n1292\", \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"reading_json\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/ocr.json\", \"manifest\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/ocr.json\", \"original_evidence_sha256\": null, \"correction_provenance\": null, \"glyph_assets\": [{\"id\": \"g001\", \"description\": \"Printed headword composed of 酉 and 名\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g002\", \"description\": \"Seal/Shuowen form of 酩 (新附)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g003\", \"description\": \"Seal/Shuowen form of 酊 (新附)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g004\", \"description\": \"Seal/Shuowen form of 醒 (新附)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g005\", \"description\": \"Seal/Shuowen form of 醍 (新附)\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g006\", \"description\": \"Printed character composed of 酉 on the bottom and 今 on top\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g007\", \"description\": \"Shang oracle-bone/bronze form 1 of 酓\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g008\", \"description\": \"Shang oracle-bone/bronze form 2 of 酓\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g009\", \"description\": \"Western Zhou bronze form of 酓\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g010\", \"description\": \"Warring States script form of 酓\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g011\", \"description\": \"Small seal form of 酓 from Shuowen jiezi xichuan\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}, {\"id\": \"g012\", \"description\": \"Small seal form of 酋 from Shuowen\", \"kind\": \"historical_form\", \"path\": null, \"source_scan\": \"/home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-books/research-ocr/ziyuan-full/page-1307/source.png\", \"source_bbox_xyxy\": null}], \"block_anchors\": [], \"entry_metadata\": \"not_extracted\", \"uncertainties\": [], \"review_queue\": [], \"review\": null, \"spatial_repair_warnings\": [], \"use\": \"provisional_research_lead_inspect_original_page\"}\n1316:{\"schema_version\": 2, \"page_id\": \"sha256:610f098b7383499e15005c51bf5908d327b3188e274cc7a1784089e9af80a721:001316\", \"b